ue，暂时不要动权限。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"小方整理材料，小卢复核，材料周二交，复核周五完成。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- 小方整理材料，周二交。\n- 小卢复核，周五完成。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"Mina owns design and Owen handles testing. Design is due Tuesday and testing Friday.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- Mina owns design, due Tuesday.\n- Owen handles testing, due Friday.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"fetchCash 的记录，fetchCash 的记录先核对，暂时不要动权限。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n先核对 fetchCash 的记录，暂时不要动权限。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"我说的 sailBoat 是帆船，不是卖船，暂时不要动。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n我说的 sailBoat 是帆船，不是卖船，暂时不要动。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"小陆核对账目，小何整理凭证，下周一开始，双方确认后再提交。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":false}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- 小陆核对账目。\n- 小何整理凭证。\n\n下周一开始，双方确认后再提交。<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"Jules checks inventory and Morgan packs the orders, begin Monday afternoon and ship only after inspection clears.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\n- Jules checks inventory.\n- Morgan packs the orders.\n\nBegin Monday afternoon and ship only after inspection clears.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"The import is complete, the staging service is still unavailable, check the results when it returns, do not publish yet.\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":false,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant\nThe import is complete. The staging service is still unavailable.\n\nCheck the results when it returns. Do not publish yet.<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>user\n{\"source\":\"Kubernetes 的升级先暂停，等兼容性检查通过再继续。\",\"sourceScripts\":{\"hasHan\":true,\"hasLatin\":true}}<|im_end|>\n<|im_start|>assistant